          "english": "Once Farrant and her colleagues feel they have a better sense of which switches to throw, they will have to find the best way to do so in useful crops. \"I'm trying three methods of breeding,\" Farrant says: conventional, genetic modification and gene editing. She says she is aware that plenty of people do not want to eat genetically modified crops, but she is pushing ahead with every available tool until one works. Farmers and consumers alike can choose whether or not to use whichever version prevails: \"I'm giving people an option.\"",
          "chinese": "一旦Farrant和她的同事更加清楚应该启动哪些开关，他们就必须找到在有用作物中启动这些开关的最佳方法。Farrant说：“我正在尝试三种育种方法：常规育种、基因改造和基因编辑。”她说，她知道很多人不愿意食用转基因作物，但她会利用一切可用的工具继续推进，直到其中一种方法奏效。农民和消费者都可以选择是否使用最终占优势的任何一种作物：“我是在给人们提供一种选择。”",
